{"seq":2,"slug":"evidence-based-medicine","title":"循证医学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"循证医学-简介\">循证医学 简介</h1><p>循证医学是现代临床实践的方法论基石，倡导将最佳研究证据、临床专业知识和患者价值偏好三者有机结合以指导医疗决策。这一理念深刻改变了医学教育、临床实践和卫生政策的面貌，已成为全球医学界的共识性框架。</p>\n<p>本课程沿着&quot;提出问题—检索证据—评价证据—综合证据—转化应用&quot;的循证实践路径展开，分四个章节层层递进。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>循证医学基础</strong>建立学科的理论起点，介绍证据等级体系的概念与分层逻辑、结构化临床问题（PICO）的构建方法，以及高效文献检索的数据库选择与策略设计。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>文献评价</strong>培养对不同类型研究进行批判性评估的能力，分别讲解随机对照试验、系统综述和诊断性研究的质量评价要点，包括偏倚识别、结果解读和适用性判断。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>证据综合</strong>聚焦多项研究成果的汇总与整合方法，涵盖系统综述的方法学流程、网状Meta分析在多干预比较中的应用，以及GRADE框架对证据质量和推荐强度的分级评判。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>证据转化与实施</strong>关注研究证据向临床行动的转化过程，讨论临床实践指南的制定与更新机制、实施科学的理论模型和影响因素，以及共同决策理念在医患沟通中的实践方式。</p>\n<p>建议学习者将循证医学的学习融入日常临床思维的训练中，每一章节的方法不仅是学术工具，更是指导实践的行动框架。阅读文献时同步练习批判性评价，效果远优于单纯记忆知识点。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"循证医学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evidence-hierarchy","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 证据等级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations/evidence-hierarchy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clinical-question-formulation","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 临床问题构建","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations/clinical-question-formulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"literature-searching","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 文献检索","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations/literature-searching"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"critical-appraisal","title":"文献评价","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/critical-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"appraising-rcts","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 随机对照试验的批判性评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/critical-appraisal/appraising-rcts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"appraising-systematic-reviews","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 系统综述的批判性评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/critical-appraisal/appraising-systematic-reviews"},{"seq":3,"slug":"appraising-diagnostic-studies","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 诊断性研究的批判性评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/critical-appraisal/appraising-diagnostic-studies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"synthesis","title":"证据综合","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/synthesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"systematic-review-methods","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 系统综述方法学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/synthesis/systematic-review-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-meta-analysis","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 网状 Meta 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/synthesis/network-meta-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grade-framework","title":"研究生 循证医学 — GRADE 框架","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/synthesis/grade-framework"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"implementation","title":"证据转化与实施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-practice-guidelines","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 临床实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/clinical-practice-guidelines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation-science","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 实施科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/implementation-science"},{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-decision-making","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 共同决策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/shared-decision-making"}]}]}